  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "让我们来看下一方程的求解过程：",
        "$\\frac{3x+2}{7}=5$，　　（1）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "有　　$3x+2=35$，　　（2）",
        "$3x=35-2$，　　（3）",
        "$3x=33$，　　（4）",
        "$x=11$。　　（5）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据性质 $5$，从方程（1）可以推出方程（2）。（将方程（1）",
        "左右两边同乘以 $7$，即得方程（2）。）根据同一性质，从方程",
        "（2）可以推出方程（1）。（将方程（2）的两边同乘以 $\\frac{1}{7}$，即得方",
        "程（1））。因此，方程（1）和方程（2）等价。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "同样，根据性质 $4$ 可以证明方程（2）和（3）等价，等等。因",
        "此，方程（1）和方程（5）等价，即方程（1）的根的集合是 $\\{11\\}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在解某些类型的方程时，必须将求解的方程用与它等价",
        "的复合语句（由两个或者几个方程组成的）来代替。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "举例如下。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 二元方程",
        "$(x-2y-15)^2+(2x+y)^2=0$",
        "和语句",
        "“$x-2y-15=0$ 和 $2x+y=0$”",
        "等价，因为两个式子的平方和等于零，当且仅当每一个式子都",
        "等于零。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们知道，用连接词“和”将两个或者几个方程连接而成",
        "的复合语句，就叫做方程组，可以用大括号将它们连在一起。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "31"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
